WEBVTT

00:11:00.491 --> 00:11:01.715
DF: Excited.

00:11:04.157 --> 00:11:09.637
High growth is pretty exciting.

00:11:09.661 --> 00:11:12.586
You hit those milestones,

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:15.183
you hit those achievements

00:11:15.207 --> 00:11:18.253
that you didn't even think were possible.

00:11:18.578 --> 00:11:20.936
It's a combination
of excited and exhausted.

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:23.356
And I think people --

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:27.073
I think struggle is kind of important
to really love your work.

00:11:27.097 --> 00:11:29.768
I think you may not
realize it at the time,

00:11:29.792 --> 00:11:32.205
but I think it's one
of those things in retrospect,